      "value": "<h2><em>Rank 1 Melee Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  8 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>          Melee</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n</ul>\n<p>A rapid flurry of jabs and kicks designed to mimic the ferocity of a desert wolf. Make 4 <em>Combo Attack Rolls</em> dealing 1d4 <em>Bludgeoning Damage</em> for each attack. At the resulution of this <strong>Technique</strong>, the target gets knocked back 5 feet for each <em>Combo Attack Roll</em> that hit.</p>\n",
